# A one-field Structure whose field is a name: in E the field is read as an actual (the name resolves to its
# Structure), W and E both fit one declaration: ambiguity (TZ 2026-11-19 §9.3; fable Р130).
(
    Observed:
        int: seen 0
)
@: shared data[0]
@: Model ()
fn: f (@: s Model; int: n 0) int
    shared\Observed\seen := 1
    return: 1
sub: main () (
    A(int: x 1)
    S(A)
)
    f(S)
main()
